# Normalise line endings on commit.
#
# Without this a collaborator on Windows commits CRLF and every file they touch
# shows as fully rewritten. It happened: a folder copy came back with CRLF
# throughout and 81 of 82 source files reported as changed, when only two had
# actually been edited. `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repo regardless of
# the checkout platform, so diffs stay honest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted — that corrupts them.
*.webp binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
